-STYLE: none; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: none; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: none; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; WIDTH: 25px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; DISPLAY: inline-block; VERTICAL-ALIGN: bottom; PADDING-TOP: 0px; transform: rotate(0deg)"></SECTION><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px -13px 0px -10px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; DISPLAY: inline-block; VERTICAL-ALIGN: bottom; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(121,42,29) 2px solid; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(121,42,29) 2px solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BORDER-TOP: rgb(121,42,29) 2px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(121,42,29) 2px solid; PADDING-TOP: 0px; border-radius: 14px"><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 28px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 15px; PADDING-RIGHT: 15px; COLOR: rgb(121,42,29); FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; transform: rotate(0deg)">
<P style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: 2px; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-SIZE: 18px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><STRONG style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 37px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 18px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">因情·相聚</SPAN></STRONG></SPAN></P></SECTION></SECTION></SECTION><SECTION style="BOX-SIZING: border-box; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; WIDTH: 40px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; DISPLAY: inline-block; VERTICAL-ALIGN: bottom; PADDING-TOP: 0px; transform: rotate(0deg)"></SECTION></SECTION></ARTICLE></SECTION>
<P style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 37px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 37px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">为了能实现在毕业六十周年重聚的心愿，从去年11月份起，王士燮校友就发起组织了绍兴一中<SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">1960</SPAN>届高三（<SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">2</SPAN>）班同学群。经过大半年的共同努力，除已经去世的<SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">8</SPAN>位和实在没有线索找不到的<SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">2</SPAN>位外，其余<SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">42</SPAN>位同学都已经全部找到。此次毕业</SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">60<SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">周年同学会，参会同学最小</SPAN>78<SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">岁，最大</SPAN>85<SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">岁。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">已近耄耋，苍颜白发，暮年聚首，畅叙友情，着实少见。</SPAN></SPAN></P><SECTION style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px" data-author="Wxeditor"><ARTICLE style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 5px auto; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-SIZE: 14px; PADDING-TOP: 0px" data-author="Wxeditor" data-id="928" data-use="1">
<P style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020102009574167.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020102009574159.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020102009574131.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020102009574170.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020102009574152.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR></P></ARTICLE></SECTION>
<P style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 37px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">为了此次相聚，老人们不顾旅途艰辛，风尘仆仆的从各地赶来。校长王琛对1960届高三（<SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">2</SPAN>）班校友一行的到来表示热烈欢迎，带领他们参观了新学校的校史博物馆、鲁迅工作室、元培纪念馆，并介绍了近年来学校的发展情况、办学特色和办学成绩等。重返朝思暮想的母校，重游魂牵梦萦的校园，共同追溯<SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">6</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">0</SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">年的芳华，校友们有着无限的感动，也有着无限的欣喜。他们为母校日新月异的变化喝彩，为母校所卓越出色的成绩自豪，并真切祝愿母校能够越办越好。</SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020102009580849.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020102009580849.jpg" width=1200 onload=resizepic(this) height=801> </A></P>
<P style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 37px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">在校园参观结束后，1960届高三（<SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">2</SPAN>）班校友与学校领导和教师、学生代表进行了座谈，他们还集体向学校捐赠大尺幅国画牡丹图。这幅国画牡丹图是王士燮先生的爱人、著名牡丹画家李艾娴所作，将它作为<SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">1960</SPAN>届高三（<SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">2</SPAN>）班全体同学的礼物献给母校，希望母校能够像牡丹花一样国色天香，繁荣昌盛。</SPAN></P>
<P style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 37px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">随后，在母校老师的陪同下，1960届高三（<SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">2</SPAN>）班校友前往当年学习的地方——一中仓桥旧址（现一初教育集团龙山校区）参观，重温昔日求学时光。</SPAN></P>
<P style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-INDENT: 37px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">“这次聚会是短暂的，再长的宴席也会有散席的时候，但同学的情谊却是永存的，母校的恩情将会永远铭记心头。”作为同学会的组织者，鲁绍成老先生的文字情真意切，六十年前的“缘”使之相遇，六十年后的“情”使之相聚。从少年到白头，在他们举手投足间呈现的是岁月沉淀的独特魅力，向这些老人们致敬，祝愿您们能够拥有幸福安康的晚年，常回母校看看！</SPAN></P></SECTION></SECTION><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020102009582854.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020102009582854.jpg" width=4000 onload=resizepic(this) height=3000> </A><BR class=Apple-interchange-newline>
    
